est/committed configuration bookkeeping\", \"A5\": \"Leader commit indication invokes processLogs\"}, \"existing_protections\": [], \"source_ids\": [\"S-append\", \"S-config-replay\", \"S-net-fastpath\", \"S-startup\"], \"unknowns\": [\"Concurrent fast-path interaction with blocked ordinary RPCs needs separate schedules\", \"Storage failure after truncation leaves an explicitly noted cached-lastLog concern\"]}}, \"B-apply\": {\"before\": {}, \"after\": {\"id\": \"B-apply\", \"primary_activity\": \"A5\", \"execution_owner\": \"Main loop processLogs and single FSM goroutine\", \"protocol_context\": \"Ordered indexes after lastApplied, with optional per-index future\", \"trigger\": \"Committed prefix dispatched to FSM\", \"legal_preconditions\": [], \"implementation_guards\": [\"Skip indexes already dispatched\", \"Batch response length checked\"], \"reads\": [], \"writes\": [\"lastApplied records dispatch progress; FSM worker separately tracks its applied index/term\"], \"durable_effects\": [], \"external_effects\": [\"Commands call FSM.Apply or ApplyBatch before successful future completion; barriers ordered on same worker\"], \"important_branches\": [\"No-op does not call FSM\", \"Configuration delivery depends on protocol and optional ConfigurationStore/BatchingFSM\", \"Follower application derives from received leader commit indication, not local quorum counting\"], \"async_boundaries\": [\"Buffered fsmMutateCh; completion differs from main-loop lastApplied\"], \"produces_fact_ids\": [\"F-applied\"], \"consumes_fact_ids\": [\"F-commit\"], \"cross_activity_effects\": {}, \"existing_protections\": [], \"source_ids\": [\"S-dispatch-apply\", \"S-fsm-worker\", \"S-fsm-contract\", \"S-leader-loop\", \"S-append\"], \"unknowns\": [\"Application-specific deterministic FSM semantics are caller owned\"]}}, \"B-commit\": {\"before\": {}, \"after\": {\"id\": \"B-commit\", \"primary_activity\": \"A1\", \"execution_owner\": \"Locked commitment object and leader main loop\", \"pr